WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:48.670 --> 01:51.250
<i>What am I going to do...?</i>

01:58.220 --> 02:03.720
<i>Shikaido-sensei saw me transform!!!</i>

02:03.720 --> 02:06.180
<i>Ahhh! What am I going to do?!</i>

02:06.180 --> 02:11.150
<i>I bet everybody knows! My high school life is over!</i>

02:11.150 --> 02:13.980
<i>Maybe he didn't notice!</i>

02:17.150 --> 02:20.660
<i>He did notice! If he told anyone...</i>

02:21.410 --> 02:24.040
<i>Kaitou Jeanne's identity is Maron!</i>

02:24.040 --> 02:27.080
<i>So you've been lying to me all this time!</i>

02:27.080 --> 02:28.580
<i>You're pathetic!</i>

02:30.460 --> 02:33.130
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

02:33.130 --> 02:38.090
<i>I can't go to school anymore! I can't even stay in this city!</i>

02:38.590 --> 02:41.930
Maron! Come on, Maron!

02:41.930 --> 02:43.640
She's completely unconscious.

02:43.640 --> 02:46.220
Forget it! Let's go, Chiaki!

02:47.100 --> 02:51.100
<i>Why can't you be by my side at a time like this, Fin?!</i>

02:51.100 --> 02:54.520
<i>Fin! Answer me, Fin!</i>

02:57.530 --> 03:01.990
An Indomitable Spirit Blazing to Cheer Up

03:09.000 --> 03:11.500
I don't want to go to school...

03:14.130 --> 03:16.420
You're alone today...

03:41.610 --> 03:42.910
Thank you.

03:42.910 --> 03:45.740
Ikaros, what's the matter?

03:45.740 --> 03:49.290
Um, has Ikaros done anything?

03:49.290 --> 03:51.620
No, a pot suddenly...

03:57.550 --> 04:01.090
I was in a rush and tripped...

04:01.090 --> 04:06.220
...and your dog was licking me to make me feel better.

04:06.220 --> 04:10.980
Oh, it's not Ikaros' fault! Thank goodness!

04:10.980 --> 04:15.310
Ikaros is so big that people are frightened just by his size.

04:17.900 --> 04:23.240
Frightened? He's a wonderful dog. Right, Ikaros?

04:23.240 --> 04:26.410
You're always together with Ikaros, aren't you?

04:26.410 --> 04:30.700
Yes, he's my best friend! Or should I say "like family?"

04:30.700 --> 04:33.040
I understand that feeling...

04:33.040 --> 04:36.920
I have someone like that, too. A close friend who's like part of the family.

04:36.920 --> 04:38.880
Maron!

04:39.590 --> 04:43.470
She's far away now, though...

04:43.470 --> 04:46.470
You're so lucky to be together all the time.

04:47.390 --> 04:49.640
Ikaros is pretty strict.

04:49.640 --> 04:54.140
I wanted to sleep in, but he woke me up, saying "It's time to walk me..."

04:54.140 --> 04:56.940
"...You have to exercise more!"

04:56.940 --> 05:00.360
Today isn't the first time. Whenever I feel down,

05:00.360 --> 05:04.530
he cheers me up or scolds me.

05:07.280 --> 05:08.570
W-What?

05:08.570 --> 05:10.370
He said "Cheer up!"

05:10.370 --> 05:14.410
It's like he's saying "Stand on your own two feet!"

05:14.410 --> 05:18.380
You're right. Thank you, Ikaros.

05:19.630 --> 05:22.000
My name is Kusakabe Maron.

05:22.000 --> 05:25.010
I'm Segawa Tsugumi and this is Segawa Ikaros.

05:27.220 --> 05:30.600
Oh, you really seem to be feeling much better!

05:30.600 --> 05:33.560
You can tell? Just by shaking my hand?

05:34.270 --> 05:37.480
It's an inner eye that God gave me.

05:39.480 --> 05:41.440
Oh no! School!

05:41.440 --> 05:43.110
See you later!

05:45.570 --> 05:49.530
Bah! This stuff sends chills up my spine!

05:52.660 --> 05:55.250
Ikaros, what's the matter? Ikaros!

05:55.250 --> 05:59.120
I need to give you a reward.

06:08.590 --> 06:11.600
I'm going to be late!!!

06:11.600 --> 06:14.140
You do not have to be in such a rush.

06:14.140 --> 06:16.180
Shikaido-sensei!

06:16.180 --> 06:19.060
You can just call me Hijiri. Did you oversleep?

06:19.060 --> 06:23.020
Are you pushing yourself too hard? In more ways than one...

06:25.530 --> 06:26.940
What is it?

06:26.940 --> 06:29.740
Eh, uh, no...

06:37.200 --> 06:42.840
"Cheer up! Stand on your own two feet!"

06:42.840 --> 06:47.510
That's right! You can't just run away! You have to make certain, Maron!

06:48.550 --> 06:49.880
Um...!

06:49.880 --> 06:54.350
Is there something troubling you? Is there anything I can do?

06:54.350 --> 06:59.690
That's not it! Kaitou Jeanne appeared at the school last night, didn't she?!

06:59.690 --> 07:02.560
Oh, yes. That Kaitou...

07:02.560 --> 07:04.520
I saw her.

07:04.520 --> 07:07.030
What about it..?

07:07.030 --> 07:09.490
Well, then...

07:24.380 --> 07:29.260
All of a sudden, she concealed herself in the bushes.

07:30.010 --> 07:33.550
She is extremely agile.

07:33.550 --> 07:35.810
Is that it?

07:35.810 --> 07:40.310
Yes, she was so quick that I did not see her very well.

07:40.310 --> 07:43.690
Secretly, I'm a fan of Kaitou Jeanne.

07:43.690 --> 07:44.650
Fan?

07:44.650 --> 07:45.520
Yes.

07:45.520 --> 07:47.570
She is a thief.

07:47.570 --> 07:52.030
However, the items she steals vary in numerous ways.

07:52.030 --> 07:56.450
I think she has some other motive behind stealing them.

07:56.450 --> 08:00.620
As an educator, that is what I find intriguing.

08:00.620 --> 08:05.670
That's right! Maybe her motives are not bad...

08:05.670 --> 08:08.670
<i>Thank goodness! I wasn't seen!</i>

08:08.670 --> 08:12.800
<i>Hijiri-sensei is even concerned about Jeanne...</i>

08:17.100 --> 08:19.100
Class is about to start.

08:28.610 --> 08:30.610
Excuse me!

08:33.780 --> 08:37.570
<i>The Petit Claire is...! Could it be? Could it be?</i>

08:40.740 --> 08:41.200
Fin!

08:43.000 --> 08:44.540
Maron.

08:46.670 --> 08:49.670
Fin, you said you'd be right back!

08:49.670 --> 08:50.460
What kept you?!

08:50.460 --> 08:54.760
I'm sorry, Maron. It's going to take me a little bit longer to become a Full-Angel.

08:54.760 --> 08:58.760
But I'm so glad I got in contact with you!

08:58.760 --> 09:03.810
Demons have reappeared! You said we sealed all of them! So why?!

09:03.810 --> 09:06.730
I can change into Jeanne without--

09:06.730 --> 09:08.900
I don't have much time.

09:08.900 --> 09:15.650
Maron, Demons are reappearing because Access and Sinbad are conjuring up Demons from the Demon World!

09:15.650 --> 09:16.610
I knew it...!

09:16.610 --> 09:18.160
That's what I wanted to say.

09:18.160 --> 09:21.990
Listen, Access and Sinbad are enemies!

09:21.990 --> 09:24.750
God said to be careful of those two, as well.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.330
I know.

09:27.210 --> 09:30.750
Hey, Fin! How much longer...

09:35.840 --> 09:37.760
Fin...

09:38.470 --> 09:41.060
I'm not going to lose.

09:43.220 --> 09:48.150
With the decryption of the Rosetta Stone that was discovered at the time, Egyptian archaeology...

09:48.150 --> 09:52.230
...Kusakabe-san! Please stand up and go to your seat.

09:52.230 --> 09:54.320
<i>How did he know?</i>

09:54.320 --> 09:57.070
What were you doing, you slowpoke?!

09:57.070 --> 09:58.280
Shut up!

10:12.290 --> 10:14.840
I'm disgusted with you, Maron!

10:14.840 --> 10:20.470
Since even Miyako's shouting doesn't wake you, I guess alarm clocks won't be enough.

10:21.850 --> 10:26.140
Ikaros! Ikaros! Where are you?!

10:26.140 --> 10:27.350
Tsugumi-san!

10:27.350 --> 10:28.520
You know her?

10:28.520 --> 10:30.350
Yes, a little.

10:30.350 --> 10:32.190
Tsugumi-san?

10:32.190 --> 10:33.610
Kusakabe-san?

10:33.610 --> 10:35.820
Ikaros is gone!

10:36.610 --> 10:39.320
Nothing like this has ever happened!

10:39.320 --> 10:40.860
Who's Ikaros?

10:40.860 --> 10:42.620
A guide dog?

10:42.620 --> 10:45.080
He's an important member of Tsugumi-san's family.

10:45.080 --> 10:47.290
He's a really kind dog and...

10:47.290 --> 10:48.750
What the...!

10:49.290 --> 10:50.790
It's towards the plaza!

10:50.790 --> 10:52.460
Hurry! Run!

10:52.460 --> 10:54.460
I'm scared!

10:54.460 --> 10:55.880
Ikaros!

10:55.880 --> 10:57.300
Tsugumi-san!

10:57.300 --> 10:59.300
Does it sound like Ikaros?

10:59.300 --> 11:01.010
It sounds similar!

11:02.180 --> 11:03.470
Let's go!

11:07.470 --> 11:08.890
This is horrible...

11:13.900 --> 11:14.860
Ikaros!

11:14.860 --> 11:16.400
Is it really...?!

11:16.400 --> 11:17.900
I'm calling the police.

11:17.900 --> 11:18.780
Miyako!

11:18.780 --> 11:21.030
It'll be too late if someone gets injured!

11:21.030 --> 11:24.280
I'm sorry! I'll calm him down!

11:24.280 --> 11:28.080
Hey! Is that your dog? Hurry up and do something!

11:30.960 --> 11:34.460
Ikaros, calm down! Ikaros!

11:34.460 --> 11:35.630
Tsugumi-san!

11:38.840 --> 11:41.380
<i>The Petit Claire is reacting!</i>

11:41.380 --> 11:44.340
<i>Could a Demon be possessing Ikaros?!</i>

11:44.340 --> 11:47.810
<i>- Now what are you going to do, Jeanne?</i>

11:44.930 --> 11:48.680
<i>- Come here, Ikaros! Be a good boy!</i>

11:49.140 --> 11:51.020
Let me put this harness on you!

11:51.020 --> 11:54.610
Let's go home together, okay? Ikaros!

12:06.280 --> 12:07.160
Look out!

12:11.330 --> 12:12.580
Maron!

12:12.580 --> 12:13.960
Dad!

12:13.960 --> 12:16.630
I was just in the neighborhood.

12:16.630 --> 12:18.500
Haruta, call headquarters.

12:18.500 --> 12:20.550
We need to block off the area and find the dog!

12:20.550 --> 12:21.220
Yes, sir!

12:21.220 --> 12:24.050
I'll help, too. I have an anti-Jeanne trap!

12:24.050 --> 12:26.260
Okay. Get it set up.

12:26.890 --> 12:29.560
What's going to happen to Ikaros?

12:29.560 --> 12:33.310
We'll try our best to capture him without harming him, however...

12:33.310 --> 12:35.980
...it's more important that no one is injured.

12:36.940 --> 12:39.480
In the worst-case scenario, we may have to put him down.

12:40.280 --> 12:43.110
No! Please don't kill Ikaros!

12:43.110 --> 12:47.030
I'll never be able to walk again if Ikaros is gone!

12:48.080 --> 12:49.740
Tsugumi-san...

12:49.740 --> 12:52.870
What should I do?! Ikaros...

12:52.870 --> 12:55.080
Ikaros!

12:56.080 --> 13:04.010
<i>If a Demon is possessing Ikaros, would he disappear if I 'Checkmate' him? But...</i>

13:06.510 --> 13:10.510
<i>...Ikaros is an irreplaceable member of Tsugumi-chan's family.</i>

13:11.140 --> 13:15.520
Maron.

13:16.810 --> 13:21.320
What should I do?! Ikaros is going to get killed...

13:21.320 --> 13:24.110
Ikaros...

13:24.110 --> 13:27.030
<i>I'm not going to let that happen!</i>

13:27.410 --> 13:28.370
Maron did what?!

13:28.370 --> 13:33.450
She sent a notice! We can't goof around, Sinbad!

13:33.450 --> 13:34.960
Okay! Let's go, Access!

13:34.960 --> 13:36.000
Yeah!

13:37.880 --> 13:41.920
Not again! Why does this always happen to me?!

13:43.460 --> 13:45.970
<i>We've found the dog! We're chasing it your way!</i>

13:45.970 --> 13:48.760
Roger. We're almost finished setting up.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.850
You guys check the trap one last time.

13:50.850 --> 13:52.180
Yes, sir!

13:53.020 --> 13:58.230
Though I wonder what Jeanne is thinking, wanting to steal that dog?!

13:58.230 --> 14:02.650
I don't know. Anyway, arresting Jeanne is our number one priority.

14:02.650 --> 14:05.070
We have blockades set up all over the city.

14:05.070 --> 14:08.240
There's no way we'll let the dog escape.

14:09.950 --> 14:11.080
Here it comes!

14:11.910 --> 14:14.040
We're luring it to the plaza. Ready?!

14:17.750 --> 14:19.880
<i>Fin, lend me your power.</i>

14:19.880 --> 14:22.290
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:43.900 --> 14:46.030
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:46.030 --> 14:48.110
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:48.110 --> 14:49.910
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:56.620 --> 15:01.000
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

15:05.300 --> 15:06.800
<i>Game Start!</i>

15:08.300 --> 15:09.260
Stop!

15:16.770 --> 15:17.720
Fuyuta-san!

15:17.720 --> 15:19.060
I have no choice! Fire!

15:23.610 --> 15:25.150
What? Huh? Where?

15:25.150 --> 15:26.320
- It's Jeanne!

15:25.610 --> 15:26.320
- Where?

15:26.320 --> 15:27.030
She's here!

15:27.030 --> 15:29.240
Everyone, get into your positions!

15:37.910 --> 15:40.790
Steal it if you can, Jeanne!

15:49.340 --> 15:50.550
Damn!

15:50.550 --> 15:52.340
- Don't let it get away!

15:51.260 --> 15:52.340
- Yes, sir!

15:56.430 --> 15:57.560
Now!

16:06.190 --> 16:07.860
I'm not letting you get away!

16:13.700 --> 16:16.410
Group D! Stop Jeanne and the dog!

16:21.830 --> 16:24.420
Kaitou Sinbad has arrived.

16:26.130 --> 16:27.840
Don't get in my way!

16:29.760 --> 16:31.510
Sinbad!

16:33.630 --> 16:37.350
Bah! We just saved you! How rude!

16:37.350 --> 16:38.890
It is what it is...

16:38.890 --> 16:41.520
Stop!!!

16:42.890 --> 16:45.190
Let's go! We've got one more mission to do.

16:45.190 --> 16:46.270
Oh yeah!

16:55.860 --> 16:58.740
<i>Ikaros, where are you headed?</i>

17:01.040 --> 17:02.700
<i>Could it be...!</i>

17:17.550 --> 17:19.100
Ikaros!

17:20.060 --> 17:22.720
You've returned!

17:22.720 --> 17:24.810
- Don't get near him!

17:24.810 --> 17:25.850
Who is it?!

17:25.850 --> 17:28.150
That's not Ikaros!

17:28.150 --> 17:30.150
It's a Demon!

17:30.150 --> 17:32.360
No, it's Ikaros.

17:32.360 --> 17:35.610
He's returned to me for my sake.

17:35.610 --> 17:37.200
Right, Ikaros?

17:37.200 --> 17:37.780
No!

17:40.870 --> 17:45.040
Stop! Don't hurt Ikaros! Please!

17:45.540 --> 17:47.120
<i>Tsugumi-san...!</i>

17:50.880 --> 17:55.470
Ikaros is no longer the kind dog you once knew!

17:55.470 --> 17:59.090
If you leave him like this, someone may be injured or worse!

17:59.090 --> 18:03.470
Please! Without Ikaros, I won't be able to walk!

18:03.470 --> 18:04.890
My life will be over!

18:07.890 --> 18:09.230
Snap out of it!

18:09.230 --> 18:14.190
Right now, you're not Ikaros' partner! You're too dependent on him!

18:14.190 --> 18:17.320
You have to stand on your own two feet!

18:17.320 --> 18:20.820
You can't stay together forever!

18:29.960 --> 18:31.630
Stop, Ikaros!

18:36.010 --> 18:42.350
<i>Is it my fault? Because I depended on Ikaros too much? Is that why?</i>

18:45.470 --> 18:49.100
That's why Ikaros wanted to be free from me!

18:50.400 --> 18:52.310
Is that it?

18:55.480 --> 18:56.780
Tsugumi-chan!

19:04.700 --> 19:06.120
Don't do something foolish!

19:06.120 --> 19:10.790
Let me go! Once I'm gone, Ikaros will be free!

19:10.790 --> 19:13.920
That's why I'm going to..! I'm going to...!

19:13.920 --> 19:15.500
You idiot!

19:20.010 --> 19:25.470
A strong person like you would never understand... how I feel!

19:28.310 --> 19:30.100
I do understand.

19:31.230 --> 19:36.360
I'm...not strong, either.

19:38.320 --> 19:41.780
<i>I have someone like that, too.</i>

19:41.780 --> 19:44.870
<i>A close friend who's like part of the family.</i>

19:44.870 --> 19:49.330
She's far away now, though...

19:50.960 --> 19:52.960
Kuakabe-san...

19:58.920 --> 20:00.800
There are...

20:00.800 --> 20:02.180
...two of them?

20:10.180 --> 20:11.600
That's it!

20:11.600 --> 20:13.770
The Demon is possessing the collar!

20:23.860 --> 20:25.320
In the name of God...

20:27.490 --> 20:29.830
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:32.290 --> 20:35.290
I seal you here!

20:45.180 --> 20:46.890
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:54.100 --> 20:55.770
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:02.360 --> 21:05.410
Ikaros! Kusakabe-san!

21:23.630 --> 21:30.100
<i>Ikaros, I'm walking! On my own two feet!</i>

21:34.680 --> 21:36.440
Ikaros!

21:36.440 --> 21:38.520
It's you, Ikaros!

21:41.480 --> 21:43.440
Kusakabe-san!

21:43.440 --> 21:44.780
Maron!

21:45.570 --> 21:50.240
Just when I thought you were up early! What are you doing here?

21:50.240 --> 21:52.040
You're going to be late!

21:52.040 --> 21:54.120
Coming!

21:54.120 --> 21:55.620
See you later.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.540
Thank you!

21:59.840 --> 22:06.510
Oh, yeah. Ikaros said he doesn't want to shampoo for a while.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.590
Huh?

22:07.590 --> 22:09.300
See you later.

22:13.180 --> 22:14.680
Hurry up!

22:14.680 --> 22:16.140
Sorry, sorry!

22:16.140 --> 22:18.520
Isn't that the guide dog?

22:18.520 --> 22:21.020
No, the color is different...

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.740 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:50.400 --> 23:53.370
Autumn...that's the season for lovers.

23:53.370 --> 23:54.910
For the two lovers...

23:54.910 --> 23:56.330
Peach flavor for me...

23:56.330 --> 23:57.790
...and chestnut flavor for me.

23:57.790 --> 24:00.080
A perfectly delightful, refreshing sports drink!

24:00.080 --> 24:03.120
Piccolo Sports Drink!

24:03.120 --> 24:05.500
Drink and the two of you will fall in love!

24:05.500 --> 24:09.760
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Kaitou Finally Shows up on Commercials?!

24:09.760 --> 24:14.180
M-Maybe this commercial will be the beginning of...
